  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Mormon",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 2,
    "summary": "Mormon leads the Nephite armies—Blood and carnage sweep the land—The Nephites lament and mourn with the sorrowing of the damned—Their day of grace is passed—Mormon obtains the plates of Nephi—Wars continue. About A.D. 327–50.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass in that same year there began to be a war again between the Nephites and the Lamanites. And notwithstanding I being young, was large in stature; therefore the people of Nephi appointed me that I should be their leader, or the leader of their armies.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 136,
            "end": 141,
            "text": "Morm. 1:15 (12, 15–16)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 2:1",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore it came to pass that in my sixteenth year I did go forth at the head of an army of the Nephites, against the Lamanites; therefore three hundred and twenty and six years had passed away.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 2:2",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that in the three hundred and twenty and seventh year the Lamanites did come upon us with exceedingly great power, insomuch that they did frighten my armies; therefore they would not fight, and they began to retreat towards the north countries.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 110,
            "end": 121,
            "text": "Morm. 4:13 (13–17); 5:6."
          },
          {
            "start": 248,
            "end": 253,
            "text": "Alma 50:11; Morm. 2:29."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
