        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 2:10",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus there began to be a mourning and a lamentation in all the land because of these things, and more especially among the people of Nephi.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "3 Ne. 12:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
