        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, the city of Jashon was near the land where Ammaron had deposited the records unto the Lord, that they might not be destroyed. And behold I had gone according to the word of Ammaron, and taken the plates of Nephi, and did make a record according to the words of Ammaron.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "Morm. 1:3 (1–4)."
